# Lean profile: turns OFF loadable modules only. Merged after hackberry.config
# by build.sh --lean. build.sh verifies that no built-in (=y) option changes, so
# the kernel image stays identical and any module can be restored from a full
# build (see README: 'Restoring a module'). Generated from the module Makefiles
# against the full baseline config.
# allow-y-change: NFSD_ OCFS2_ GFS2_ CEPH_FS_ AFS_ DVB_USB_DIBUSB_

